      "instance_name": "immigration_policy",
      "label": "Immigration Policy",
      "description": "Refers to the set of laws, regulations, and administrative procedures governing the entry, stay, and exit of individuals in a country. In the context of the meme, it is implicitly referenced as the subject of Donald Trump's political rhetoric, particularly his stance on border control and undocumented immigrants. The meme frames this policy as divisive, which requires understanding of real-world immigration debates and political discourse.",
