      "instance_name": "undocumented_immigrants",
      "label": "Undocumented Immigrants",
      "description": "Individuals who reside in a country without legal authorization. The term 'illegals' used in the meme is a derogatory and inaccurate label for this group. Understanding the real-world implications of this term — including its association with xenophobia, dehumanization, and political rhetoric — is essential to interpret the meme's message and its harmful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
