      "instance_name": "social_division",
      "label": "Social Division",
      "description": "The state of being split or divided within a society, often along lines of identity, ideology, or interest. The meme explicitly frames immigration policy as a tool for creating social division, which requires understanding of sociopolitical dynamics and the real-world consequences of such rhetoric on community cohesion and intergroup relations.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
